{"ID":"20261116205420-rlp4box","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20261116205420-rlp4box","title":"Analisis Kunang-Kunang Kenanga","type":"doc","updated":"20261116205451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-l5qmspo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-l5qmspo","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ANALISIS CERPEN \"KUNANG-KUNANG KENANGA\""}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c3j3cg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c3j3cg6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Karya: Riki Kurnia"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ofcd0tz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ofcd0tz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pendahuluan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cy00d9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cy00d9f","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Kunang-kunang Kenanga"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" karya Riki Kurnia mengangkat kisah persahabatan, cinta yang terlambat disadari, kerinduan, kehilangan, dan penyesalan. Cerita disampaikan melalui sudut pandang tokoh utama yang mengenang masa kecilnya bersama seorang sahabat bernama Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xyonaih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xyonaih","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Di balik kisah kunang-kunang dan toples kaca, terdapat makna simbolis tentang seseorang yang ingin dipertahankan, tetapi tidak pernah benar-benar berhasil dimiliki."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-svd8ahq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-svd8ahq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Analisis cerpen ini meliputi unsur intrinsik, unsur ekstrinsik, dan struktur cerpen secara lengkap."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-hpnw2d1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-hpnw2d1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A. UNSUR INTRINSIK CERPEN"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-tv5lxx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tv5lxx6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unsur intrinsik merupakan unsur-unsur yang membangun cerita dari dalam karya sastra. Unsur intrinsik meliputi tema, tokoh dan penokohan, alur, latar, sudut pandang, gaya bahasa, konflik, serta amanat."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2b3o8qb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2b3o8qb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Tema"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-6h8udcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6h8udcd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tema merupakan gagasan utama atau pokok permasalahan yang menjadi dasar sebuah cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ujiuu1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ujiuu1e","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Tema utama:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-436zb9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-436zb9d","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cinta, kerinduan, dan penyesalan terhadap seseorang yang memiliki kenangan mendalam dalam kehidupan tokoh utama."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-mlr84yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-mlr84yd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tema tersebut terlihat dari kisah tokoh Aku yang sejak kecil bersahabat dengan Kenanga. Keduanya mempunyai kebiasaan berburu kunang-kunang di pinggir sawah. Namun, tokoh Aku terlambat menyadari bahwa ia sebenarnya mencintai Kenanga. Ketika Kenanga dan keluarganya pergi meninggalkan Bandung, tokoh Aku tidak sempat mengungkapkan perasaannya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-symwmnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-symwmnj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal tersebut ditegaskan melalui pengakuan tokoh Aku:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-penm2c5","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-penm2c5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-it1jzp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-it1jzp3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Aku terlambat menyadari dan terlalu lama menyia-nyiakan kesempatan. Kenyataan bahwa aku mencintaimu.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-q8bavxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-q8bavxp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Tema tambahan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-kt6h9we","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-kt6h9we","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-vhquafw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vhquafw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-hzado7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-hzado7s","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Persahabatan masa kecil yang meninggalkan kenangan mendalam."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ri3bw8x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ri3bw8x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-1qzyy10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1qzyy10","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kehilangan seseorang yang dicintai."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-d0bocmw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-d0bocmw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-q29gs2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-q29gs2a","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kesempatan yang tidak dimanfaatkan dengan baik."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xofio51","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xofio51","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-jlb1897","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jlb1897","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kesetiaan terhadap kenangan masa lalu."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-etde9qi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-etde9qi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-8pk7xr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8pk7xr0","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kepedulian terhadap kelestarian lingkungan."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vj62wel","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vj62wel","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-3l5qxx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3l5qxx4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Harapan untuk kembali bertemu dengan seseorang yang pernah berarti dalam kehidupan."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-nnxxp93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-nnxxp93","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kesimpulan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cerpen ini mengisahkan cinta dan kerinduan yang terpendam sejak masa kecil, disertai penyesalan karena tokoh utama terlambat menyadari perasaannya dan kehilangan kesempatan untuk mengungkapkannya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-io8p4bl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-io8p4bl","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Tokoh dan Penokohan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-81o5u4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-81o5u4b","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh adalah pelaku yang mengalami berbagai peristiwa dalam cerita, sedangkan penokohan merupakan gambaran sifat, karakter, dan kepribadian tokoh tersebut."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-m4z34hp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-m4z34hp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Tokoh Aku (Kunang Makaranganang)"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-09wr33x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-09wr33x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kedudukan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tokoh utama dan protagonis."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ej07d9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ej07d9o","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku merupakan tokoh sentral yang menceritakan seluruh kejadian dalam cerpen. Ia adalah sahabat masa kecil Kenanga dan seseorang yang menyimpan perasaan cinta kepadanya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8xz01sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8xz01sh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sifat dan karakter:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ifa2ler","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ifa2ler","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-l7cbvly","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-l7cbvly","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-4ssq348","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4ssq348","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penyayang:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Memiliki rasa sayang yang mendalam kepada Kenanga dan senang menemaninya berburu kunang-kunang."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-gokefdd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-gokefdd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-99zln7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-99zln7p","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Setia terhadap kenangan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tetap mengingat Kenanga meskipun sudah bertahun-tahun berpisah."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2cw6kys","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2cw6kys","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-lzz8yqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lzz8yqj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Mudah menyesal:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Menyesali keterlambatannya menyadari perasaan cinta kepada Kenanga."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-kq8rl53","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-kq8rl53","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-ipoc5kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ipoc5kb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Pemalu dan canggung:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tidak berani langsung menanyakan identitas ibu Kunang Wijaya Kusuma."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-qd6vasm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qd6vasm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-ylvnp2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ylvnp2v","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Peduli terhadap lingkungan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Melarang muridnya menangkap kunang-kunang karena populasinya semakin langka."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-i5og9nx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-i5og9nx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-v28t4m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-v28t4m4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Mudah mengenang masa lalu:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Berbagai hal sederhana, seperti toples kaca dan kunang-kunang, mengingatkannya kepada Kenanga."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-bca64cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-bca64cr","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bukti karakter tokoh Aku:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-mzdq4rd","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-mzdq4rd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-pib7znv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-pib7znv","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Inilah aku, setelah gemuruh kesunyian berabad-abad, memilih membujang hanya karena sebuah toples kaca yang tak terisi.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-lf1gglm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lf1gglm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kutipan tersebut memperlihatkan bahwa kenangan masa lalu sangat memengaruhi kehidupan tokoh Aku hingga masa tuanya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-7cx2ea9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7cx2ea9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Kenanga"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fisbmhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fisbmhh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kedudukan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tokoh penting atau tokoh pendukung."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vzgrrgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vzgrrgr","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kenanga adalah sahabat masa kecil tokoh Aku. Ia merupakan sosok yang memiliki hubungan emosional sangat dekat dengan tokoh utama."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-te1eq4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-te1eq4x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sifat dan karakter:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-toepi3a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-toepi3a","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-cp3c0al","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cp3c0al","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-vtj9n6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vtj9n6k","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Manja:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Sering bersikap manja kepada tokoh Aku, terutama ketika menginginkan kunang-kunang untuk menemaninya tidur."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-eu7xeib","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-eu7xeib","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-sttfjf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-sttfjf5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Ceria dan suka bermain:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Senang bermain dan berburu kunang-kunang bersama tokoh Aku."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wppoyc0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wppoyc0","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-ujya9wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ujya9wt","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Menyukai kunang-kunang:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Sangat menyukai kunang-kunang sehingga ingin menyimpannya di dalam toples kaca."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ybvdish","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ybvdish","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-0s207n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0s207n9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Agak keras kepala:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tetap ingin mendapatkan kunang-kunang meskipun harus membuat tokoh Aku ikut berburu."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ql05djj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ql05djj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-h5ov1ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-h5ov1ci","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Memiliki kenangan mendalam:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ketika dewasa, masih mengingat kebiasaan dan kenangan masa kecilnya bersama tokoh Aku."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c0rcyqc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c0rcyqc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-cw6okv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cw6okv1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penyayang:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Menunjukkan kepedulian dengan merawat kunang-kunang dan melepaskannya kembali."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-as25l84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-as25l84","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bukti karakter Kenanga:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ber2y49","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ber2y49","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-r6kl37n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-r6kl37n","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Mereka tidak akan mati seperti dulu kok, aku merawatnya, jam sepuluh nanti mereka akan kulepas lagi ke tempat pemeliharaan.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ijtg7q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ijtg7q9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kutipan tersebut menunjukkan bahwa Kenanga telah berubah. Dahulu ia menyimpan kunang-kunang agar bisa menemaninya tidur, sedangkan sekarang ia merawat dan berencana melepaskannya kembali."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-moqjh8x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-moqjh8x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Kunang Wijaya Kusuma"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-6azkuu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6azkuu8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kedudukan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tokoh pendukung."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-jb59dzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jb59dzw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kunang Wijaya Kusuma adalah anak laki-laki yang menjadi murid tokoh Aku ketika ia masih mengajar sebagai guru SD. Sepuluh tahun kemudian, ia telah dewasa dan mendirikan sebuah warung kopi."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-jt6cq4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jt6cq4z","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sifat dan karakter:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8wcg2b4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8wcg2b4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-1qnfgaa","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1qnfgaa","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-df33s0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-df33s0y","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Memiliki rasa ingin tahu tinggi:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mengajukan pertanyaan mengenai kunang-kunang dan keinginannya untuk memeliharanya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ayxlkwp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ayxlkwp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-yeg0dvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-yeg0dvo","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Polos:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bertanya secara jujur tentang hal-hal yang ingin diketahuinya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-suvrato","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-suvrato","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-x0gg3gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-x0gg3gv","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Ramah:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Menyambut mantan gurunya dengan baik dan memberikan secangkir kopi."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-96mqc67","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-96mqc67","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-helqhaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-helqhaf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Ceria:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Senang bercanda dan menceritakan kisah ibunya kepada tokoh Aku."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0jj02hn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0jj02hn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-t5qta12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-t5qta12","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Akrab dengan orang lain:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mengajak tokoh Aku masuk untuk menemui ibunya."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-eutoznf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-eutoznf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh ini memiliki peran penting karena menjadi penghubung antara tokoh Aku dengan Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-y29m0rs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-y29m0rs","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"d. Orang tua Kenanga"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xf46q86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xf46q86","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Orang tua Kenanga merupakan tokoh tambahan yang berperan dalam peristiwa kepindahan keluarga Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-mfc8a0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-mfc8a0n","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ayah Kenanga bekerja sebagai Pegawai Negeri Sipil (PNS) dan mendapatkan penugasan ke Jayapura. Peristiwa kepindahan tersebut menjadi salah satu penyebab terpisahnya tokoh Aku dan Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xxc13fk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xxc13fk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"e. Ayah Kunang Wijaya Kusuma"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ctw831g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ctw831g","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ayah Kunang Wijaya Kusuma merupakan tokoh yang diceritakan telah meninggal dunia ketika bertugas mengamankan aksi separatis Organisasi Papua Merdeka (OPM)."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-i7jlpry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-i7jlpry","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kehadirannya dalam cerita berfungsi menjelaskan kondisi keluarga Kenanga dan latar belakang kehidupan anaknya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3yuimjy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3yuimjy","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"f. Murid-murid tokoh Aku"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-29qcfja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-29qcfja","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Murid-murid tokoh Aku merupakan tokoh tambahan yang muncul ketika tokoh Aku sedang menjelaskan materi tentang kunang-kunang di depan kelas."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fq5p8jm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fq5p8jm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mereka menggambarkan kehidupan tokoh Aku ketika telah dewasa dan bekerja sebagai seorang guru."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-g13bwto","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-g13bwto","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. Alur atau Plot"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3ep7641","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3ep7641","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Alur merupakan rangkaian peristiwa yang membentuk jalannya cerita dari awal sampai akhir."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-jzvfow6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jzvfow6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Jenis alur: alur campuran (maju dan mundur)."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-u81rgkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-u81rgkj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen ini menggunakan alur campuran karena pengarang menggabungkan peristiwa masa sekarang dengan kenangan masa lalu melalui kilas balik atau ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"flashback"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rcbo87u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rcbo87u","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tahapan alurnya adalah sebagai berikut."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-tw0158p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tw0158p","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Tahap pengenalan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-totsy8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-totsy8g","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerita dibuka dengan suasana senja menjelang malam. Tokoh Aku sedang menunggu seseorang sambil memegang sebuah toples kaca. Ia mengingat kesepakatan masa kecilnya dengan Kenanga untuk berburu kunang-kunang di pinggir sawah."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-6dlh41d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6dlh41d","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pada bagian ini pembaca mulai mengenal kerinduan tokoh Aku kepada seseorang dari masa lalunya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-h4i2ku7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-h4i2ku7","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Tahap munculnya konflik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-n1d23l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-n1d23l9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik mulai terlihat ketika tokoh Aku mengenang masa kecilnya bersama Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-09wyub8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-09wyub8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia menyadari bahwa dirinya sebenarnya mencintai Kenanga, tetapi terlambat memahami perasaannya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-zv9nc4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-zv9nc4e","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik semakin berkembang ketika Kenanga pergi meninggalkan Bandung bersama keluarganya tanpa sempat berpamitan kepada tokoh Aku."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-n4ymcum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-n4ymcum","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Peristiwa tersebut membuat tokoh Aku kehilangan sahabat sekaligus seseorang yang dicintainya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-yw0nohx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-yw0nohx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Tahap peningkatan konflik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-n7bwoo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-n7bwoo1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik kembali muncul ketika tokoh Aku telah dewasa dan menjadi guru."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8bmp3vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8bmp3vw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Saat menjelaskan materi tentang kunang-kunang, ia bertemu dengan seorang murid bernama Kunang Wijaya Kusuma. Anak tersebut memiliki tatapan mata dan beberapa ciri fisik yang mengingatkannya kepada Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0m7ja80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0m7ja80","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku semakin penasaran setelah mendengar nama dan cerita anak tersebut."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-la08juc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-la08juc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia mulai menduga bahwa ibu anak itu adalah Kenanga, sahabat masa kecilnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-7gtrm2x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7gtrm2x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"d. Tahap klimaks"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-e6lu3jc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-e6lu3jc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Puncak konflik terjadi ketika tokoh Aku mengetahui bahwa ibu Kunang Wijaya Kusuma bernama Kenanga dan masih menyimpan kenangan tentang seseorang yang dahulu sering berburu kunang-kunang bersamanya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cy5t5o8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cy5t5o8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku semakin terkejut ketika mengetahui bahwa Kenanga ternyata masih mengingat kebiasaan masa kecil mereka."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-llzjfs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-llzjfs3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bagian ini menjadi titik penting karena tokoh Aku mulai menyadari bahwa bukan hanya dirinya yang menyimpan kenangan tersebut."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-bj81wk3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-bj81wk3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"e. Tahap penyelesaian konflik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2ht9lnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2ht9lnu","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik mulai menemui penyelesaian ketika Kunang Wijaya Kusuma mengajak tokoh Aku masuk untuk menemui ibunya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4pwljda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4pwljda","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku akhirnya kembali berhadapan dengan Kenanga setelah bertahun-tahun tidak bertemu."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rf0t4rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rf0t4rb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kenanga menyambutnya dengan cara yang mengingatkan pada kebiasaan mereka dahulu. Mereka kembali terhubung melalui kenangan masa kecil dan kunang-kunang."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xtyk3jn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xtyk3jn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"f. Tahap akhir"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5e9l2ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5e9l2ru","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerita ditutup dengan renungan tokoh Aku mengenai hubungannya dengan Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9j50ovx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9j50ovx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia menyadari bahwa dahulu Kenanga sebenarnya menginginkan kehadirannya, bukan sekadar kunang-kunang yang ditangkap di pinggir sawah."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3p53v22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3p53v22","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Akhir cerita menggambarkan harapan tokoh Aku untuk tidak lagi menghindar dan mulai membuka diri terhadap kemungkinan kembali bersama Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c9uq19g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c9uq19g","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kesimpulan alur:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cerpen menggunakan alur campuran karena terdapat perpindahan waktu antara masa kecil dan masa dewasa. Cerita dimulai dengan kerinduan tokoh Aku, bergerak melalui kenangan masa lalu, kemudian berakhir pada pertemuan kembali dengan Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-12wqdge","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-12wqdge","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. Latar atau Setting"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4s9u241","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4s9u241","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar adalah keterangan mengenai tempat, waktu, dan suasana terjadinya peristiwa dalam cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5zci4da","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5zci4da","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Latar tempat"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-foazqfh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20261116205438-foazqfh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penjelasan"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pinggiran sawah"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat tokoh Aku dan Kenanga berburu kunang-kunang ketika masih kecil."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ruang kelas"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat tokoh Aku mengajar dan menjelaskan materi tentang kunang-kunang kepada murid-muridnya."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Rumah Kenanga"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat tokoh Aku dahulu sering bermain bersama Kenanga dan menyaksikan keluarganya berkemas untuk pindah."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Warung kopi"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat tokoh Aku bertemu kembali dengan mantan muridnya dan memperoleh informasi tentang Kenanga."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tajug atau musala kecil"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat tokoh Aku dan Kenanga biasanya melaksanakan kegiatan ibadah sebelum pergi berburu kunang-kunang."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bandung"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Daerah tempat tokoh Aku dan Kenanga menghabiskan masa kecil serta tempat terjadinya perpisahan mereka."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Jayapura"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tempat tujuan kepindahan keluarga Kenanga ketika ayahnya mendapat penugasan."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tasikmalaya"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Daerah yang disebutkan sebagai tempat Kenanga kemudian tinggal dan memelihara kunang-kunang."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-dvyuy6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-dvyuy6c","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Catatan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bandung, Jayapura, dan Tasikmalaya juga disebutkan sebagai bagian dari riwayat perjalanan tokoh, bukan seluruhnya sebagai tempat berlangsungnya adegan utama."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-v2vf2bq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-v2vf2bq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Latar waktu"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-hmdzby8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-hmdzby8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-4kwgohv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4kwgohv","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-9r0kg8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9r0kg8j","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Senja menjelang malam:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika tokoh Aku menunggu seseorang."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-1uha05b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1uha05b","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-8o9mu9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8o9mu9y","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Malam hari:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika tokoh Aku dan Kenanga berburu kunang-kunang serta ketika tokoh Aku mengunjungi warung kopi."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-23gcknq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-23gcknq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-kqv1xba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-kqv1xba","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Masa kecil:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Merupakan waktu ketika tokoh Aku dan Kenanga masih bersahabat, bermain, dan berburu kunang-kunang bersama."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-qd55wmm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qd55wmm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-l9ezd3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-l9ezd3u","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Masa dewasa:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika tokoh Aku sudah menjadi guru, kemudian dosen, serta bertemu kembali dengan mantan muridnya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-e3yv3gc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-e3yv3gc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-31ftli6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-31ftli6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sepuluh tahun kemudian:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Rentang waktu yang disebutkan ketika mantan muridnya mengingat peristiwa saat tokoh Aku melarangnya menangkap kunang-kunang."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-eyykoae","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-eyykoae","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Latar suasana"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-mxjzsy5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-mxjzsy5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-k19chwy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-k19chwy","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-cip53pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cip53pd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Romantis dan penuh kerinduan:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat dari kenangan tokoh Aku terhadap Kenanga dan keinginannya untuk bertemu kembali."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-pnp7pkf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-pnp7pkf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-0uhbhdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0uhbhdj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sedih:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika Kenanga meninggalkan Bandung tanpa berpamitan kepada tokoh Aku."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ha2gm7k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ha2gm7k","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-y7q4y27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-y7q4y27","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sepi dan sunyi:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat dari kehidupan tokoh Aku yang memilih membujang dan terus mengenang masa lalunya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cnxdvjr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cnxdvjr","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-x8ue1zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-x8ue1zl","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Tegang dan cemas:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika tokoh Aku mengetahui bahwa keluarga Kenanga sedang berkemas, tetapi ia tidak berani menanyakan tujuan kepindahan mereka."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-1zcbxzb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1zcbxzb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-8mrud6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8mrud6r","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Bahagia dan haru:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika tokoh Aku akhirnya mengetahui keberadaan Kenanga dan berkesempatan bertemu kembali dengannya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-u91zcdx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-u91zcdx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-tifn3ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tifn3ya","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Hangat dan akrab:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Terlihat ketika Kenanga mengajak tokoh Aku masuk dan mengingatkan kebiasaan lamanya menggunakan sarung."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-y8apkro","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-y8apkro","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. Sudut Pandang"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-14htem2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-14htem2","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sudut pandang merupakan posisi pengarang dalam menyampaikan cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0npj2f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0npj2f0","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Sudut pandang yang digunakan adalah orang pertama pelaku utama."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-366ka2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-366ka2u","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal ini terlihat dari penggunaan kata ganti \"aku\" sebagai tokoh yang mengalami sendiri berbagai peristiwa dalam cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ze2ah2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ze2ah2c","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku menceritakan pengalaman masa kecilnya, hubungannya dengan Kenanga, penyesalannya, hingga pertemuan kembali setelah dewasa."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-tzem3lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tzem3lb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Selain menggunakan kata \"aku\", narasi juga banyak menggunakan kata \"kau\" atau \"engkau\" untuk menyapa Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-onznroi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-onznroi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contoh kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-iyj8gf1","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-iyj8gf1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-7jk7po4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7jk7po4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Ini aku Kenanga, sahabatmu, Kunang Makaranganang.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fcv00sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fcv00sq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kutipan tersebut memperlihatkan bahwa cerita disampaikan langsung oleh tokoh Aku sebagai pelaku utama."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-mz6y5vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-mz6y5vn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Pengaruh penggunaan sudut pandang ini:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-akob6ri","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-akob6ri","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-b08s4o8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-b08s4o8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-kawg7v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-kawg7v1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pembaca dapat memahami perasaan tokoh utama secara mendalam."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rgpsqrz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rgpsqrz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-1jw4qdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1jw4qdn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerita terasa lebih pribadi dan emosional."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ufrexbc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ufrexbc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-1epz9x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1epz9x7","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pembaca mengetahui kenangan, kerinduan, dan penyesalan tokoh Aku."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-eub2o6d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-eub2o6d","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-t7g44gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-t7g44gq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Informasi tentang Kenanga pada awalnya terbatas pada apa yang diketahui dan diingat oleh tokoh Aku."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8lile24","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8lile24","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. Gaya Bahasa"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-lwytma1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lwytma1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Gaya bahasa merupakan cara pengarang menggunakan bahasa untuk menyampaikan cerita agar lebih menarik, indah, dan bermakna."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9pdyw7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9pdyw7o","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dalam cerpen ini terdapat beberapa gaya bahasa."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-n9e1urp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-n9e1urp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Personifikasi"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4hmkud3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4hmkud3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Personifikasi adalah gaya bahasa yang memberikan sifat manusia kepada benda, keadaan, atau sesuatu yang bukan manusia."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-7ge9og8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7ge9og8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Contoh:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9pn9u5c","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9pn9u5c","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-iblzlqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-iblzlqx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Senja dan azan magrib saling berkejaran.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0szjutg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0szjutg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Senja dan azan magrib digambarkan seolah-olah dapat berlari atau saling mengejar seperti manusia."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9aktgx3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9aktgx3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Metafora"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-w7atpg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-w7atpg5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Metafora adalah gaya bahasa yang membandingkan sesuatu secara langsung tanpa menggunakan kata pembanding."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4z0s9yc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4z0s9yc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Contoh:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-34k58kn","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-34k58kn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-lgv688q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lgv688q","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Toples itu yang mewakili rinduku padamu.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vlag7ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vlag7ug","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Toples kaca bukan hanya benda untuk menangkap kunang-kunang, tetapi menjadi simbol kerinduan tokoh Aku terhadap Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vp3afza","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vp3afza","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Hiperbola"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-a7q0a1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-a7q0a1x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hiperbola adalah gaya bahasa yang melebih-lebihkan sesuatu untuk memberikan penekanan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-czcy7y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-czcy7y0","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Contoh:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cg7h67k","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cg7h67k","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-f9q9p54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-f9q9p54","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Setelah gemuruh kesunyian berabad-abad.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-og06tnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-og06tnk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ungkapan tersebut menggambarkan kesepian tokoh Aku yang sangat panjang dan mendalam, bukan berarti ia benar-benar mengalami kesunyian selama berabad-abad."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-o7t6mad","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-o7t6mad","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"d. Citraan penglihatan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vhhx7gy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vhhx7gy","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Citraan penglihatan merupakan penggunaan kata-kata yang membuat pembaca seolah-olah dapat melihat suatu peristiwa."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-qxltfh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qxltfh0","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Contoh:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-q8irhoh","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-q8irhoh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-av9hjnp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-av9hjnp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Merah saga berubah warna, menggelap, lambat-lahan menggulita.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wexmnq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wexmnq4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pengarang menggambarkan perubahan warna langit pada waktu senja hingga malam."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-uowmy1i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uowmy1i","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"e. Citraan pendengaran"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3wjpfyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3wjpfyb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Citraan pendengaran merupakan penggunaan kata-kata yang memberikan gambaran tentang suara."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2zxsela","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2zxsela","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Contoh:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9rcd1gw","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9rcd1gw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-jxnfubm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jxnfubm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Gemericik airnya yang berkilauan di antara reribuan kunang-kunang.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c780wuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c780wuh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kata \"gemericik\" memberikan gambaran bunyi air yang mengalir."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5szbfyo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5szbfyo","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"f. Simbolisme"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8wt3fnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8wt3fnj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Simbolisme merupakan penggunaan benda atau hal tertentu untuk mewakili makna yang lebih luas."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ekdby27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ekdby27","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya adalah kunang-kunang, toples kaca, dan sarung yang memiliki makna lebih dalam daripada fungsi bendanya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cthp5i5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cthp5i5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"g. Bahasa dialog"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5bmrq19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5bmrq19","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pengarang menggunakan percakapan antartokoh dengan bahasa yang sederhana dan alami."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-954quq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-954quq3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Contoh:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-e3wta61","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-e3wta61","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-80vhkrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-80vhkrh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Bolehkah kunang-kunang itu dipelihara?\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rxknv6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rxknv6s","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dialog tersebut membuat cerita terasa hidup serta membantu menggambarkan karakter tokohnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-t4jov33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-t4jov33","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kesimpulan gaya bahasa:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cerpen ini menggunakan bahasa yang puitis, imajinatif, simbolis, dan emosional. Penggunaan majas dan citraan membuat suasana kerinduan serta kenangan masa lalu terasa lebih kuat."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c4x6prh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c4x6prh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. Konflik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8oigrwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8oigrwa","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik adalah pertentangan atau permasalahan yang dialami oleh tokoh dalam cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vfsg6b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vfsg6b3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dalam cerpen ini terdapat dua jenis konflik."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-yglnl07","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-yglnl07","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Konflik internal (batin)"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-zu3pftf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-zu3pftf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik internal merupakan pertentangan yang terjadi di dalam diri tokoh."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ljhx90z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ljhx90z","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik internal yang dialami tokoh Aku antara lain:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-l94ovvp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-l94ovvp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-brjbul3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-brjbul3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-2t3hxic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2t3hxic","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penyesalan karena terlambat menyadari bahwa dirinya mencintai Kenanga."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ecjdpu7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ecjdpu7","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-ro4lj5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ro4lj5u","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kerinduan terhadap Kenanga yang telah lama pergi."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cl74mfa","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cl74mfa","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-a0f91qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-a0f91qi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ketakutan kehilangan Kenanga ketika mengetahui keluarganya sedang berkemas."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3pcqr9y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3pcqr9y","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-v7o287d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-v7o287d","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Rasa malu dan canggung ketika ingin menanyakan identitas ibu Kunang Wijaya Kusuma."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-sh7nab6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-sh7nab6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-x2drgck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-x2drgck","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kebingungan ketika mengetahui bahwa Kenanga ternyata masih mengingat dirinya."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8jh6bz5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8jh6bz5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Konflik eksternal"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rk2kgtl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rk2kgtl","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik eksternal merupakan pertentangan yang melibatkan tokoh dengan tokoh lain atau keadaan di luar dirinya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wtkiw61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wtkiw61","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik eksternal yang terdapat dalam cerpen antara lain:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fgjkqdc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fgjkqdc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-xq7q32f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xq7q32f","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-x13crvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-x13crvc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku terlambat datang ketika hendak berburu kunang-kunang bersama Kenanga."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0hqhq75","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0hqhq75","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-rlhphny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rlhphny","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kenanga pergi meninggalkan Bandung sehingga persahabatan mereka terpisah."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xlv7f7c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xlv7f7c","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-s1v28vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-s1v28vi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kerusakan ekosistem menyebabkan kunang-kunang semakin langka."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-x0i5b5c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-x0i5b5c","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-2uuqbzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2uuqbzq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Keadaan kehidupan yang membuat Kenanga harus berpindah tempat tinggal dan menghadapi kehilangan suaminya."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xf7nika","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xf7nika","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kesimpulan konflik:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Konflik utama dalam cerpen adalah konflik batin tokoh Aku berupa cinta, kerinduan, dan penyesalan karena kehilangan kesempatan untuk bersama Kenanga. Konflik tersebut diperkuat oleh perpisahan, perpindahan tempat tinggal, dan perubahan keadaan kehidupan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cn8w018","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cn8w018","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. Amanat"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-waixaan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-waixaan","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Amanat adalah pesan moral atau pelajaran yang ingin disampaikan pengarang kepada pembaca."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-zspmurh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-zspmurh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Amanat yang terkandung dalam cerpen ini antara lain:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-28re4nb","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-28re4nb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-3q1oddi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3q1oddi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-uf88bvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uf88bvd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Jangan menyia-nyiakan kesempatan untuk mengungkapkan perasaan."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tokoh Aku terlambat menyadari perasaannya kepada Kenanga sehingga kesempatan untuk mengungkapkan cinta terlewatkan."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ihobd8o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ihobd8o","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-yx5b13i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-yx5b13i","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Hargailah seseorang yang hadir dalam kehidupan kita."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Seseorang yang dekat dengan kita mungkin memiliki arti yang sangat besar, meskipun terkadang kita baru menyadarinya setelah berpisah."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-36p4iaq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-36p4iaq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-p40clzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-p40clzt","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Jangan terlalu lama menunda sesuatu yang penting."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Penundaan dapat menyebabkan penyesalan ketika kesempatan tersebut tidak dapat diulang."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4qkjcby","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4qkjcby","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-jzwfc8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jzwfc8d","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Jagalah kelestarian lingkungan dan makhluk hidup."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Kunang-kunang tidak seharusnya ditangkap dan dipenjarakan di dalam toples hanya untuk kesenangan manusia."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-huzmp97","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-huzmp97","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-9b9hovd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9b9hovd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kenangan masa lalu dapat menjadi bagian penting dalam kehidupan seseorang."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Pengalaman dan hubungan yang pernah dijalani dapat meninggalkan pengaruh yang mendalam."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-uw7p5dd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uw7p5dd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-rs8cos5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rs8cos5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Jangan takut untuk memperbaiki hubungan dan membuka diri."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Pertemuan kembali tokoh Aku dan Kenanga memberikan gambaran bahwa kesempatan untuk membangun hubungan kembali masih mungkin ada."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ehjfwld","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ehjfwld","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-igl2gqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-igl2gqc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Hargailah arti kehadiran seseorang, bukan hanya apa yang dapat diberikan olehnya."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Keinginan Kenanga sebenarnya bukan semata-mata mendapatkan kunang-kunang, melainkan kehadiran seseorang yang menemaninya."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-mq6nbmk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-mq6nbmk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. Simbol-Simbol dalam Cerpen"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-po02373","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-po02373","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Kunang-kunang Kenanga"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" tidak hanya menyampaikan cerita secara langsung, tetapi juga menggunakan benda dan peristiwa sebagai simbol."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-45z9x5z","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20261116205438-45z9x5z","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Simbol"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Makna dalam cerita"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kunang-kunang"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Melambangkan kenangan, cinta, harapan, kerinduan, dan seseorang yang ingin dipertahankan."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Toples kaca"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Melambangkan keinginan untuk memiliki atau mempertahankan sesuatu yang dicintai."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sawah"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Melambangkan tempat tumbuhnya kenangan masa kecil tokoh Aku dan Kenanga."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Senja"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Melambangkan peralihan waktu serta kenangan tentang masa lalu."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sarung"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Menjadi bagian dari identitas dan kebiasaan tokoh Aku sejak kecil, sekaligus simbol kedekatan masa lalu."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Jalan"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Melambangkan perjalanan kehidupan, perpisahan, dan kesempatan untuk kembali bertemu."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nama Kunang"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Melambangkan kenangan Kenanga terhadap tokoh Aku yang masih terbawa hingga masa depan."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-62imlbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-62imlbd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Makna penting simbol kunang-kunang dan toples:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c8li93b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c8li93b","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kunang-kunang menggambarkan sesuatu yang indah dan ingin dipertahankan. Namun, ketika ditangkap dan dimasukkan ke dalam toples, kunang-kunang justru kehilangan kebebasannya dan dapat mati."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-uws3ruz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uws3ruz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal ini dapat dimaknai sebagai gambaran bahwa cinta tidak selalu berarti memiliki seseorang. Terkadang, mencintai berarti menghargai kebebasan dan membiarkan seseorang menjalani kehidupannya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vhang95","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vhang95","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B. UNSUR EKSTRINSIK CERPEN"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-dw4jkdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-dw4jkdd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unsur ekstrinsik merupakan unsur yang berasal dari luar karya sastra, tetapi memiliki hubungan dengan isi, latar belakang, dan pesan cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ti6vup5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ti6vup5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dalam menganalisis unsur ekstrinsik, perlu dibedakan antara informasi yang benar-benar disebutkan dalam cerpen dan penafsiran berdasarkan isi cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-6a8ytsp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6a8ytsp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Latar Belakang Pengarang"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-o204lrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-o204lrj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen ini ditulis oleh ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Riki Kurnia"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, dengan keterangan afiliasi Universitas Gadjah Mada yang tercantum pada naskah."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rvzcmcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rvzcmcd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Namun, dalam naskah cerpen yang diberikan tidak terdapat informasi lengkap mengenai kehidupan pribadi, riwayat pendidikan, pengalaman, ataupun latar belakang keluarga pengarang."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-47swjip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-47swjip","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Oleh karena itu, tidak dapat dipastikan bahwa semua peristiwa dalam cerita merupakan pengalaman pribadi Riki Kurnia."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-lbpqnxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lbpqnxr","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Berdasarkan karya yang ditulis, dapat diamati bahwa cerpen ini menunjukkan perhatian pengarang terhadap:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-r6i83ue","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-r6i83ue","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-9oubesw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9oubesw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-cmm19g5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cmm19g5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Persahabatan dan hubungan antarmanusia."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-u4tnvie","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-u4tnvie","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-uc1d1qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uc1d1qi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Perasaan cinta yang terpendam."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-jb5wr00","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-jb5wr00","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-1wfrd1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1wfrd1f","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kenangan masa kecil."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-zecmawd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-zecmawd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-985m2yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-985m2yx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kepedulian terhadap lingkungan."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-yueb469","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-yueb469","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-iuosldj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-iuosldj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penyesalan akibat kehilangan kesempatan."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-j42mv5t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-j42mv5t","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Latar Belakang Masyarakat"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-nwf8zss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-nwf8zss","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar belakang masyarakat adalah kondisi sosial yang tergambar dalam kehidupan masyarakat pada cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-q7hmqw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-q7hmqw2","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Beberapa kondisi sosial yang terlihat dalam cerpen ini adalah:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xygqk0o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xygqk0o","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Kehidupan masyarakat pedesaan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-s6rokhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-s6rokhn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerita menggambarkan kehidupan masyarakat yang dekat dengan lingkungan alam, seperti sawah, sungai, rawa-rawa, dan musala kecil."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-qkgc1qn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qkgc1qn","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Lingkungan tersebut menjadi tempat tokoh Aku dan Kenanga menghabiskan masa kecilnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2pthcl3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2pthcl3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Kehidupan masyarakat yang religius"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-48ts6jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-48ts6jh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku dan Kenanga memiliki kebiasaan melaksanakan salat dan mengaji."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0dnc5e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0dnc5e8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal tersebut menunjukkan bahwa kegiatan keagamaan merupakan bagian dari kehidupan sehari-hari mereka."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-usnm9t1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-usnm9t1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Kehidupan dunia pendidikan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ycpxtyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ycpxtyp","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku bekerja sebagai guru SD honorer sebelum kemudian menjadi dosen di Universitas Siliwangi."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-95y8rwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-95y8rwg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerita juga menggambarkan hubungan antara guru dan murid serta perkembangan materi pendidikan yang diterima siswa."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-6430jwx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6430jwx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"d. Kehidupan ekonomi"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-41oc5ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-41oc5ak","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku pernah mengalami kondisi ekonomi yang kurang stabil ketika menjadi guru honorer karena menerima gaji yang tidak menentu."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-gdqhqcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-gdqhqcj","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal ini menggambarkan persoalan kesejahteraan tenaga pendidik dalam kehidupan masyarakat."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rby0im5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rby0im5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"e. Perpindahan penduduk karena pekerjaan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-m71bdel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-m71bdel","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Keluarga Kenanga harus berpindah ke Jayapura karena ayahnya memperoleh penugasan sebagai Pegawai Negeri Sipil."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-950kc96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-950kc96","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal ini menggambarkan bahwa pekerjaan dapat memengaruhi tempat tinggal dan hubungan sosial seseorang."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wr45yee","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wr45yee","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. Nilai-Nilai yang Terkandung dalam Cerpen"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5cbr0j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5cbr0j4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai-nilai kehidupan merupakan bagian penting dari unsur ekstrinsik karena memperlihatkan pelajaran yang dapat diterapkan dalam kehidupan nyata."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-z68cxr3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-z68cxr3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Nilai moral"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4taa35d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4taa35d","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai moral berkaitan dengan perilaku baik dan buruk manusia."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wnbz4lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wnbz4lk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-bycyt2r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-bycyt2r","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-qrd4n8y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qrd4n8y","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-76fgmd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-76fgmd6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Menghargai seseorang yang menyayangi kita."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-8ibt1vu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-8ibt1vu","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-g1othby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-g1othby","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tidak menyia-nyiakan kesempatan."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-lod48qm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lod48qm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-eltu79j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-eltu79j","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tidak memaksakan kehendak kepada orang lain."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-r2fyu4k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-r2fyu4k","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-87vqtnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-87vqtnf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Menyadari kesalahan dan berusaha memperbaikinya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-qpz72eq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qpz72eq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-6kmto3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6kmto3f","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Menghargai kebebasan makhluk hidup."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-olb6ijy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-olb6ijy","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku memberikan gambaran bahwa keterlambatan menyadari perasaan dapat menimbulkan penyesalan yang mendalam."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2xey2nx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2xey2nx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Nilai sosial"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-hxk5umb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-hxk5umb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai sosial berkaitan dengan hubungan manusia dengan manusia lainnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fydaikh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fydaikh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-558fffo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-558fffo","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-byxvmsg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-byxvmsg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-fnpauai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fnpauai","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Persahabatan antara tokoh Aku dan Kenanga."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-13m99sq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-13m99sq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-en4aax2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-en4aax2","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kebersamaan dalam bermain dan melakukan kegiatan sehari-hari."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wezt4yz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wezt4yz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-eaxysh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-eaxysh8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hubungan baik antara guru dan murid."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-225uth3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-225uth3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-f159qlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-f159qlg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sikap ramah Kunang Wijaya Kusuma kepada mantan gurunya."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-j4qsqgl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-j4qsqgl","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-tge164w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tge164w","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kepedulian terhadap orang yang memiliki hubungan emosional dengan kita."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-1c5bcyf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1c5bcyf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Nilai religius"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-hrrt3vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-hrrt3vk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai religius berkaitan dengan kehidupan keagamaan dan hubungan manusia dengan Tuhan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-m8r7hgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-m8r7hgr","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya terlihat dari kebiasaan tokoh Aku dan Kenanga yang salat di tajug serta mengaji sebelum bermain."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-7ms0g52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7ms0g52","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2untue8","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2untue8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-pmm1s4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-pmm1s4u","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Selepas salat di tajug, aku selalu menyempatkan mampir ke pinggiran sawah itu.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-23p44ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-23p44ct","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hal ini menunjukkan bahwa kegiatan keagamaan menjadi bagian dari kehidupan sehari-hari tokoh."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-r0b7vkg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-r0b7vkg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"d. Nilai budaya"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-sn9kwnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-sn9kwnd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai budaya berkaitan dengan kebiasaan, tradisi, dan identitas masyarakat."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-1n31s2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1n31s2q","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-kcvh48s","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-kcvh48s","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-wi8x0qt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wi8x0qt","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-s9ooi4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-s9ooi4x","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penggunaan kain sarung dalam kehidupan sehari-hari."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rvnrvqk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rvnrvqk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-ewuayag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ewuayag","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penggunaan mukena ketika melaksanakan ibadah."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-m2yoes9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-m2yoes9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-vd03uso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vd03uso","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penyebutan tajug sebagai musala kecil dalam budaya Sunda."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-89j04s4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-89j04s4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-5yfckyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5yfckyb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penyebutan Pak Ajengan sebagai panggilan kepada tokoh agama."}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-yc07hy7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-yc07hy7","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261116205438-gxuwo3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-gxuwo3p","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penggambaran lingkungan masyarakat Sunda."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-b9kf9ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-b9kf9ve","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai tersebut memperlihatkan unsur budaya lokal yang menjadi bagian dari kehidupan para tokoh."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-6z7yu7g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-6z7yu7g","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"e. Nilai pendidikan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-or3t51o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-or3t51o","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai pendidikan berkaitan dengan kegiatan belajar mengajar dan pembentukan pengetahuan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-tvbungl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tvbungl","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya terlihat ketika tokoh Aku menjelaskan materi tentang kunang-kunang kepada muridnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-qjfvvwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-qjfvvwu","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia memberikan pengetahuan tentang jenis dan habitat kunang-kunang sekaligus mengajarkan pentingnya menjaga kelestarian lingkungan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-j6ej0ph","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-j6ej0ph","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"f. Nilai lingkungan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ntuha42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ntuha42","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai lingkungan berkaitan dengan hubungan manusia dengan alam dan makhluk hidup lainnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-18t0rf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-18t0rf8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Contohnya terlihat dari larangan tokoh Aku kepada muridnya untuk menangkap kunang-kunang karena populasinya semakin langka akibat kerusakan ekosistem."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-1nnhbv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1nnhbv9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai ini mengajarkan manusia agar tidak merusak habitat makhluk hidup dan tidak mengambil hewan dari alam hanya untuk kepentingan pribadi."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-v064t98","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-v064t98","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"g. Nilai sejarah dan sosial-politik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-nvxc58a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-nvxc58a","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen juga menyinggung peristiwa konflik di Papua melalui cerita mengenai ayah Kunang Wijaya Kusuma yang meninggal dunia setelah tertembak ketika bertugas mengamankan aksi separatis Organisasi Papua Merdeka (OPM)."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ygu6qg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ygu6qg1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bagian ini menunjukkan bahwa konflik sosial-politik dapat memberikan dampak terhadap kehidupan keluarga, termasuk kehilangan anggota keluarga dan perubahan kehidupan seorang anak."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-b72zzr8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-b72zzr8","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C. STRUKTUR CERPEN"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-kmb1tj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-kmb1tj1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Struktur cerpen adalah susunan bagian-bagian cerita yang membentuk sebuah karya secara utuh."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-lyxzfez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lyxzfez","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pada umumnya, struktur cerpen terdiri atas enam bagian, yaitu abstrak, orientasi, komplikasi, evaluasi, resolusi, dan koda."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9le70iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9le70iw","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Berikut struktur cerpen ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Kunang-kunang Kenanga"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xrlojhe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xrlojhe","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Abstrak"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-09p77vs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-09p77vs","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Abstrak merupakan bagian pembuka yang memberikan gambaran umum tentang isi cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-207152l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-207152l","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dalam cerpen ini, bagian abstrak tidak disajikan secara terpisah atau secara eksplisit. Namun, gambaran umum cerita dapat ditemukan pada bagian awal ketika tokoh Aku mengungkapkan kerinduannya kepada seseorang sambil memegang toples kaca."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-t074nq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-t074nq9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia mengenang kesepakatan masa kecil untuk berburu kunang-kunang bersama Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-lsrdanh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-lsrdanh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fh29lyi","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fh29lyi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-sd6axu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-sd6axu1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Toples itu yang mewakili rinduku padamu, perburuan itu jua yang kurindukan dari kehadiranmu.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-82blgvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-82blgvx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penjelasan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-g1j2wz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-g1j2wz9","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kutipan tersebut memberikan gambaran umum bahwa cerita akan membahas kerinduan tokoh Aku kepada seseorang dari masa lalu. Toples dan kunang-kunang menjadi simbol awal tentang kenangan dan hubungan antara kedua tokoh."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-bno0aat","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-bno0aat","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Orientasi"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4o5nhqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4o5nhqo","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Orientasi merupakan bagian pengenalan tokoh, latar, suasana, dan situasi awal cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-98xedwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-98xedwb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pada bagian ini, pembaca diperkenalkan dengan tokoh Aku yang sedang menunggu seseorang pada waktu senja sambil memegang toples kaca."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-nk0i3bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-nk0i3bd","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kemudian, diceritakan bahwa tokoh Aku dan Kenanga dahulu merupakan sahabat masa kecil yang sering berburu kunang-kunang di pinggiran sawah."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-dtj3fmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-dtj3fmq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pembaca juga mulai mengetahui bahwa tokoh Aku mempunyai kerinduan yang mendalam terhadap Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-pcabkx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-pcabkx6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-uoewn77","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uoewn77","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-1648k9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-1648k9n","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Kita sepakat akan berburu kunang-kunang malam itu, di pinggiran sawah biasa.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-zhp4mfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-zhp4mfi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penjelasan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wy6b4sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wy6b4sq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bagian ini memperkenalkan hubungan persahabatan tokoh Aku dan Kenanga, sekaligus latar tempat yang menjadi bagian penting dalam cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-b3053d1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-b3053d1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. Komplikasi"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-izyohjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-izyohjf","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Komplikasi merupakan bagian ketika masalah mulai muncul dan berkembang sehingga menimbulkan konflik dalam cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-429wyll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-429wyll","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pada cerpen ini, komplikasi terlihat ketika tokoh Aku mulai mengenang masa lalunya bersama Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5qmir25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5qmir25","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia menyadari bahwa sebenarnya ia mencintai Kenanga, tetapi tidak pernah benar-benar mengungkapkan perasaannya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-osn55kt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-osn55kt","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Masalah semakin berkembang ketika Kenanga pergi meninggalkan Bandung bersama keluarganya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2uzq0eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2uzq0eq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-tk8oxx7","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tk8oxx7","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-4lxtpat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4lxtpat","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Setelah berkemas, kau sekeluarga pergi meninggalkan Bandung tanpa pamitan padaku.\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-9jbb9ta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-9jbb9ta","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penjelasan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-469lyzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-469lyzm","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kepergian Kenanga menjadi awal perpisahan yang panjang antara kedua sahabat tersebut. Tokoh Aku kehilangan seseorang yang sangat berarti dalam hidupnya dan terus menyimpan penyesalan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-f0stfx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-f0stfx3","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Komplikasi juga berkembang ketika tokoh Aku dewasa bertemu dengan murid bernama Kunang Wijaya Kusuma yang mengingatkannya kepada Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xuz8o36","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xuz8o36","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. Evaluasi"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-scyd7yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-scyd7yt","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Evaluasi merupakan bagian ketika konflik semakin memuncak dan tokoh mulai menghadapi atau memahami permasalahan yang terjadi."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fdlq157","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fdlq157","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pada cerpen ini, evaluasi terlihat ketika tokoh Aku mulai mengetahui identitas ibu Kunang Wijaya Kusuma."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-w2veswz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-w2veswz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ia mengetahui bahwa nama ibu anak tersebut adalah Kenanga. Informasi ini membuatnya semakin yakin bahwa perempuan yang selama ini dikenangnya mungkin benar-benar sahabat masa kecilnya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-c0y1py4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-c0y1py4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vv834xt","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vv834xt","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-zykvy1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-zykvy1l","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Nama ibu juga tak kalah aneh dan terlalu panjang untuk ukuran orang Sunda: Kenanga Intan Nadita Rahmat Jaya Kusuma!\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3awfc3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3awfc3h","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Selain itu, tokoh Aku memperoleh informasi bahwa Kenanga masih mengingat seseorang yang dahulu sering berburu kunang-kunang bersamanya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cy8d3vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cy8d3vi","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penjelasan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ezsr91o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ezsr91o","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bagian ini menjadi puncak ketegangan emosional karena tokoh Aku hampir memastikan bahwa perempuan yang selama ini dirindukannya masih ada dan masih menyimpan kenangan tentang dirinya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wflq7lg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wflq7lg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. Resolusi"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-0062nx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-0062nx5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Resolusi merupakan bagian penyelesaian konflik atau masalah yang dialami oleh para tokoh."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-l808cos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-l808cos","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dalam cerpen ini, resolusi terjadi ketika Kunang Wijaya Kusuma mengajak tokoh Aku menemui ibunya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vehiiyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vehiiyg","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku akhirnya bertemu kembali dengan Kenanga setelah sekian lama berpisah."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-imtqt11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-imtqt11","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-xo4mov4","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-xo4mov4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-t91c78b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-t91c78b","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Ayo masuk, bukannya kau selalu dikungkuyung sarung. Angin malam terlalu dingin untukmu!\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vno79i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vno79i6","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penjelasan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-uctijri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-uctijri","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ajakan Kenanga tersebut menjadi tanda bahwa hubungan emosional mereka masih memiliki kedekatan. Kenanga juga masih mengingat kebiasaan tokoh Aku ketika masa kecil."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-a0pf6jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-a0pf6jx","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pertemuan tersebut memberikan kesempatan bagi tokoh Aku untuk kembali berhadapan dengan orang yang selama ini dirindukannya."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-w1qp2go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-w1qp2go","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Namun, perlu diperhatikan bahwa cerpen tidak menjelaskan secara tegas bagaimana hubungan mereka selanjutnya. Penyelesaian yang diberikan lebih menekankan pertemuan kembali dan terbukanya kesempatan untuk memperbaiki hubungan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4soj8vq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4soj8vq","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. Koda"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-3jh6zh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-3jh6zh1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Koda merupakan bagian penutup yang berisi pesan, kesimpulan, atau renungan dari keseluruhan cerita."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-655eyc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-655eyc4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pada cerpen ini, koda terlihat pada bagian akhir ketika tokoh Aku mengungkapkan penyesalan sekaligus harapannya kepada Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fvkpkbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fvkpkbv","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Kutipan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4d1v3s4","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4d1v3s4","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20261116205438-01rbdua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-01rbdua","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"Maafkan Aku yang terlalu lama terbang, tidak ada kata terlambat, bukan? Mungkin kini saat yang tepat untuk melepaskan sayap?\""}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-khzbr5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-khzbr5r","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Penjelasan:"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-2omwl22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-2omwl22","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kutipan tersebut mengandung makna bahwa tokoh Aku menyadari kesalahannya karena terlalu lama menyimpan perasaan dan tidak pernah benar-benar mendekati Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fstz39i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fstz39i","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ungkapan \"terlalu lama terbang\" dapat dimaknai sebagai gambaran dirinya yang selama ini terus menghindar atau tidak berani menetap dalam hubungan tersebut."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-orcomrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-orcomrc","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sementara itu, \"melepaskan sayap\" dapat dimaknai sebagai keinginannya untuk berhenti menghindar dan mulai membuka diri."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-tb55hsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-tb55hsz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bagian akhir ini memberikan pesan bahwa seseorang sebaiknya tidak terus-menerus membiarkan kesempatan berlalu tanpa berusaha melakukan sesuatu."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-cxhnl4j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-cxhnl4j","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"D. TABEL RINGKASAN ANALISIS CERPEN"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-fy6a24q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-fy6a24q","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Ringkasan unsur intrinsik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-i3zpu6w","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20261116205438-i3zpu6w","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"No."}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unsur"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hasil Analisis"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tema"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cinta, kerinduan, persahabatan, dan penyesalan."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh utama"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Aku (Kunang Makaranganang)."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh pendukung"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kenanga, Kunang Wijaya Kusuma, orang tua Kenanga, ayah Kunang, dan murid-murid."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penokohan"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku penyayang, setia, pemalu, dan penuh penyesalan. Kenanga manja, ceria, dan penuh kenangan. Kunang Wijaya Kusuma ramah dan memiliki rasa ingin tahu."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Alur"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Campuran, yaitu maju dan mundur."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar tempat"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pinggiran sawah, tajug, rumah Kenanga, ruang kelas, warung kopi, Bandung, Jayapura, dan Tasikmalaya."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar waktu"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Senja, malam hari, masa kecil, dan masa dewasa."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar suasana"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Romantis, sedih, sepi, tegang, haru, dan hangat."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sudut pandang"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Orang pertama pelaku utama (aku)."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Gaya bahasa"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Personifikasi, metafora, hiperbola, citraan, simbolisme, dan dialog."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Konflik batin berupa cinta dan penyesalan serta konflik eksternal berupa perpisahan dan kehilangan."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Amanat"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Jangan menyia-nyiakan kesempatan, hargai orang yang menyayangi kita, dan jagalah kelestarian alam."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-7kiv0x5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7kiv0x5","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Ringkasan unsur ekstrinsik"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-bz2zpsb","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20261116205438-bz2zpsb","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"No."}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unsur"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hasil Analisis"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar belakang pengarang"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Riki Kurnia, dengan afiliasi Universitas Gadjah Mada sebagaimana tercantum pada naskah."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Latar belakang masyarakat"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kehidupan masyarakat pedesaan, dunia pendidikan, perpindahan penduduk, dan kehidupan sosial masyarakat Sunda."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai moral"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tidak menyia-nyiakan kesempatan dan menghargai orang lain."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai sosial"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Persahabatan, kebersamaan, kepedulian, dan hubungan antarmanusia."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai religius"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Salat dan mengaji sebagai bagian kehidupan sehari-hari."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai budaya"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penggunaan sarung, mukena, tajug, dan istilah ajengan."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai pendidikan"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Kegiatan belajar mengajar dan penyampaian pengetahuan tentang kunang-kunang."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai lingkungan"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Menjaga habitat serta kelestarian kunang-kunang."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai sejarah dan sosial-politik"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penyebutan konflik OPM di Papua dan dampaknya terhadap kehidupan keluarga."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nilai ekonomi"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Penggambaran ketidakpastian gaji guru honorer."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4jf7bh1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4jf7bh1","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. Ringkasan struktur cerpen"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ip96bbh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20261116205438-ip96bbh","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"No."}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Struktur"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Isi dalam Cerpen"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Abstrak"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Gambaran kerinduan tokoh Aku terhadap Kenanga melalui toples dan kunang-kunang. Tidak disajikan secara terpisah."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Orientasi"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pengenalan tokoh Aku, Kenanga, suasana senja, dan kebiasaan berburu kunang-kunang."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Komplikasi"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku terlambat menyadari perasaannya dan Kenanga pergi meninggalkan Bandung."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Evaluasi"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku bertemu Kunang Wijaya Kusuma dan mulai mengetahui keberadaan Kenanga."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Resolusi"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tokoh Aku akhirnya dipertemukan kembali dengan Kenanga."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Koda"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Renungan tentang penyesalan, kerinduan, dan keinginan untuk tidak lagi menghindar."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-wrifizx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-wrifizx","updated":"20261116205451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"E. KESIMPULAN KESELURUHAN"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-7yf1h2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-7yf1h2n","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Kunang-kunang Kenanga"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" karya Riki Kurnia menceritakan perjalanan kehidupan seorang laki-laki bernama Kunang Makaranganang yang menyimpan kenangan mendalam terhadap sahabat masa kecilnya, Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ximinsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ximinsk","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sejak kecil, mereka mempunyai kebiasaan berburu kunang-kunang bersama di pinggir sawah. Namun, tokoh Aku terlambat menyadari bahwa dirinya mencintai Kenanga. Ketika Kenanga pergi meninggalkan Bandung bersama keluarganya, ia tidak sempat mengungkapkan perasaannya. Bertahun-tahun kemudian, saat telah dewasa, ia bertemu dengan mantan muridnya yang ternyata merupakan anak Kenanga. Pertemuan tersebut akhirnya membuka jalan bagi tokoh Aku untuk bertemu kembali dengan Kenanga."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-5a3xs3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-5a3xs3j","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cerpen ini menggunakan ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"alur campuran, sudut pandang orang pertama pelaku utama, serta gaya bahasa yang puitis dan simbolis"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​. Unsur yang paling menonjol adalah simbol kunang-kunang dan toples kaca yang menggambarkan kerinduan, kenangan, keinginan untuk memiliki, dan kebebasan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-vhwxqkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-vhwxqkz","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dari segi ekstrinsik, cerpen ini mengandung nilai moral, sosial, religius, budaya, pendidikan, ekonomi, dan lingkungan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-ysn1gkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-ysn1gkv","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Pesan utama yang dapat diambil dari cerpen ini adalah jangan sampai kita terlambat menyadari arti kehadiran seseorang dalam kehidupan."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hargailah orang-orang yang menyayangi kita, jangan menyia-nyiakan kesempatan, dan jangan membiarkan rasa takut membuat kita terus kehilangan hal-hal berharga. Selain itu, kita juga harus belajar menghargai kebebasan makhluk hidup dan menjaga kelestarian lingkungan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-4xl9379","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-4xl9379","updated":"20261116205451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Catatan"}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-33txu2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-33txu2r","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Analisis unsur intrinsik dan ekstrinsik di atas didasarkan pada isi cerpen yang diberikan."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-rpul352","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-rpul352","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Khusus bagian latar belakang pengarang, informasi biografi Riki Kurnia tidak tersedia secara lengkap dalam naskah, sehingga tidak dibuat-buat."}]},{"ID":"20261116205438-szjmira","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205438-szjmira","updated":"20261116205438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Struktur abstrak juga bersifat opsional dalam cerpen dan pada karya ini tidak dipisahkan secara eksplisit. Pembagian struktur lainnya merupakan hasil pengelompokan tahapan cerita berdasarkan peristiwa yang terdapat dalam cerpen."}]},{"ID":"20261116205451-nol9x1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261116205451-nol9x1c","updated":"20261116205451"}}]}